@coldniko Running Qwen 3.8 Flash-Next (UD-Q4_K_XL) on Strata with my RTX 5090 &amp; 96 GB of system RAM...

262k ctt window, ~100 tok/s at short context and still 80+ tok/s past 128k. Absolutely nuts. 🔥

I don't know what kind of sorcery you did @coldniko, but it's absolutely marvelous. 🧙🏼‍♂️

