@BrianRoemmele Strat is amazing! A powerful local LLM FTW!

I have installed and run it on my Intel Xeon Gold 6312U (Ice Lake) with 128 GB RAM, with the models on Toshiba XG6 NVMe and an Nvidia RTX 3090, 24 GB.

I'm getting 80-110+ tok/s on short prompts and over 70 tok/s on long prompts. https://t.co/3JUwskEbMC

